title: Instructions/find_calls

Every call and definition of a macro, procedure, function or custom widget, in every call form, per tiddler with the anchors `edit_tiddler` takes. The scope defaults to non-system tiddlers; include shadows to see the core macros:

```
find_calls(name="list-links", filter="[all[shadows+tiddlers]]")
```

See [[find_calls]] for parameters and output.
